    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619450/extras/5c151a7f95860cb6082c3b7e574c6398.poster.avif?t=1753751820\" width=616 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619450/extras/5c151a7f95860cb6082c3b7e574c6398.webm?t=1753751820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619450/extras/5c151a7f95860cb6082c3b7e574c6398.mp4?t=1753751820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Immerse yourself in an exhilarating adventure where sexy girls are your reward. In each room, these delightfully curvy surprises are waiting to be revealed with a simple click. Unearth their secrets and brace yourself for the enchanting surprises that follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619450/extras/681481d15cbd170b05af8d6af734d254.poster.avif?t=1753751820\" width=616 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619450/extras/681481d15cbd170b05af8d6af734d254.webm?t=1753751820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619450/extras/681481d15cbd170b05af8d6af734d254.mp4?t=1753751820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Delve into the heart of the tower and unveil its best-kept mysteries as you journey through 13 floors of uniquely crafted rooms, each brimming with hidden delights and surprising encounters. With over 600 waifus waiting to be discovered, the promise of thrilling revelations and passionate moments is yours to explore.</p><p 